    {
      "id": "narja-s-voracity-and-predation",
      "title": {
        "en": "Narja's Voracity and Predation"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1052_uni1",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1052_uni4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Voracity\nWhen at 50%> HP, when an ally hits with an attack card +30-40% Damage Bonus\nAt any HP Threshold Voracity is Activated you will heal a small fixed ammount\nPredation\nWhen attack card hits give +110%-140% Damage Bonus\nUnfortunately all of these are consumed on HIT not per card use\nNarja can give 140% damage increase\nShackles of Hunger 340% After using 1"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
